    "title": "Culver City 4 Peace to Hold Book Sale @ Jackson Market - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago Come and grab a book – make a donation; it’s all that simple. On Feb. 28 and March 1, Culver City 4 Peace will be holding Book Sale at Jackson Market, at 4065 Jackson Ave. from 8 am to 8 pm. The books for sale will be from the library of the late Conor Proffitt, and people are also welcome to donate books. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
